meta {
  name: List the catalogue
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{host}}/books?pageNumber=1&pageSize=20&title=Refactoring&includeInactive=false
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  200. Served through Redis when a matching page is cached; every catalogue write drops the
  whole listing prefix, so the page a write invalidated is rebuilt on the next call.

  pageNumber starts at 1 and pageSize is capped at 200. Both are validated, so 0 or 100000
  answers 400 rather than being silently clamped - an unbounded page size is one request
  asking the database to materialise the whole catalogue.

  Deactivated books are excluded unless includeInactive=true: browsing shows what can be
  borrowed, and a withdrawn title is still reachable by asking for it directly.
}
